{"page":289,"width":1778,"height":2387,"text_angle":0,"lines":[{"text":"습니다. 이제는 바뀐 상횡에 대한 새로운 대처방안을 마련해야 합니다. 그 방안은 네 번째 경우에서","words":[{"text":"습니다.","x":184,"y":191,"width":111,"height":35},{"text":"이제는","x":312,"y":189,"width":99,"height":35},{"text":"바뀐","x":422,"y":189,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"상횡에","x":499,"y":189,"width":94,"height":36},{"text":"대한","x":607,"y":189,"width":63,"height":35},{"text":"새로운","x":680,"y":189,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"대처방안을","x":783,"y":190,"width":150,"height":36},{"text":"마련해야","x":943,"y":191,"width":119,"height":34},{"text":"합니다.","x":1072,"y":190,"width":95,"height":35},{"text":"그","x":1181,"y":194,"width":31,"height":25},{"text":"방안은","x":1222,"y":190,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"네","x":1325,"y":191,"width":28,"height":36},{"text":"번째","x":1369,"y":192,"width":59,"height":36},{"text":"경우에서","x":1444,"y":194,"width":130,"height":36}]},{"text":"이어서 설명하겠습니다.","words":[{"text":"이어서","x":187,"y":257,"width":98,"height":34},{"text":"설명하겠습니다.","x":300,"y":256,"width":235,"height":35}]},{"text":"형제 노드를","words":[{"text":"형제","x":193,"y":781,"width":52,"height":28},{"text":"노드를","x":252,"y":781,"width":76,"height":26}]},{"text":"C는 여전히 검은색 2개를 갖고 있다.","words":[{"text":"C는","x":197,"y":1251,"width":46,"height":28},{"text":"여전히","x":251,"y":1252,"width":71,"height":27},{"text":"검은색","x":331,"y":1252,"width":71,"height":27},{"text":"2개를","x":410,"y":1253,"width":67,"height":27},{"text":"갖고","x":484,"y":1253,"width":51,"height":26},{"text":"있다.","x":542,"y":1253,"width":54,"height":27}]},{"text":"이중혹색 \"-COI","words":[{"text":"이중혹색","x":1344,"y":358,"width":107,"height":29},{"text":"\"-COI","x":1463,"y":360,"width":75,"height":26}]},{"text":"할간색으로 칠하고","words":[{"text":"할간색으로","x":1368,"y":878,"width":126,"height":27},{"text":"칠하고","x":1502,"y":878,"width":81,"height":27}]},{"text":"@-c. 형제가 검은색이고 형제의 오른쪽 자식이 달간색인 경우","words":[{"text":"@-c.","x":196,"y":1356,"width":86,"height":33},{"text":"형제가","x":296,"y":1354,"width":9