모","x":1160,"y":1496,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"노드를","x":1230,"y":1496,"width":93,"height":33},{"text":"기준으로","x":1334,"y":1494,"width":127,"height":36},{"text":"좌회전","x":1472,"y":1493,"width":103,"height":35}]},{"text":"하면 0번 규칙이 지켜집니다.","words":[{"text":"하면","x":193,"y":1564,"width":62,"height":35},{"text":"0번","x":266,"y":1564,"width":65,"height":35},{"text":"규칙이","x":341,"y":1563,"width":94,"height":35},{"text":"지켜집니다.","x":449,"y":1563,"width":168,"height":36}]},{"text":"이번에도 그림 예제가 준비되어 있습니다. 방금 전에 다뤘던 ㉣-B의 마지막 그림부터 시작하겠습","words":[{"text":"이번에도","x":194,"y":1641,"width":125,"height":34},{"text":"그림","x":330,"y":1640,"width":62,"height":34},{"text":"예제가","x":408,"y":1641,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"준비되어","x":516,"y":1640,"width":127,"height":34},{"text":"있습니다.","x":660,"y":1639,"width":127,"height":35},{"text":"방금","x":803,"y":1639,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"전에","x":875,"y":1637,"width":57,"height":35},{"text":"다뤘던","x":946,"y":1637,"width":88,"height":35},{"text":"㉣-B의","x":1047,"y":1638,"width":104,"height":33},{"text":"마지막","x":1166,"y":1637,"width":92,"height":35},{"text":"그림부터","x":1268,"y":1637,"width":122,"height":35},{"text":"시작하겠습","x":1408,"y":1636,"width":169,"height":36}]},{"text":"니다. c가 이중 흑색 노드였고 형제인 E 노드는 검은색, 형제의 오른쪽 자식 노드 D는 빨간색입니","words":[{"text":"니다.","x":195,"y":1706,"width":68,"height":34},{"text":"c가","x":277,"y":1706,"width":57,"height":33},{"text":"이중","x":345,"y":1706,"width":65,"height":34},{"text":"흑색","x":420,"y":1706,"width":62,"height":33},{"text":"노드였고","x":496,"y":1704,"width":131,"height":34},{"text":"형제인","x":639,"y":1705,"width":91,"height":34},{"text":"E","x":742,"y":1710,"width":20,"height":25},{"text":"노드는","x":774,"y":1705,"width":91,"height":32},{"text":"검은색,","x":876,"y":1702,"width":95,"height":36},{"text":"형제의","x":987,"y":1702,"width":86,"height":35},{"text":"오른쪽","x":1086,"y":1704,"width":92,"height":32},{"text":"자식","x":1188,"y":1702,"width":58,"height":35},{"text":"노드","x":1260,"y":1706,"width":64,"height":25},{"text":"D는","x":1334,"y":1704,"width":62,"height":32},{"text":"빨간색입니","x":1407,"y":1700,"width":165,"height":37}]},{"text":"다. 우선 E를 부모 노드인 A의 색인 빨간색으로 칠합니다 그다음에는 부모 노드 A와 오른쪽 자식","words":[{"text":"다.","x":193,"y":1770,"width":38,"height":33},{"text":"우선","x":246,"y":1770,"width":63,"height":33},{"text":"E를","x":320,"y":1771,"width":55,"height":31},{"text":"부모","x":386,"y":1771,"width":65,"height":32},{"text":"노드인","x":462,"y":1768,"width":97,"height":33},{"text":"A의","x":570,"y":1768,"width":57,"height":34},{"text":"색인","x":642,"y":1769,"width":61,"height":32},{"text":"빨간색으로","x":716,"y":1769,"width":149,"height":33},{"text":"칠합니다","x":877,"y":1767,"width":125,"height":33},{"text":"그다음에는","x":1017,"y":1766,"width":152,"height":35},{"text":"부모","x":1179,"y":1768,"width":61,"height":34},{"text":"노드","x":1251,"y":1770,"width":63,"height":26},{"text":"A와","x":1324,"y":1768,"width":60,"height":34},{"text":"오른쪽","x":1394,"y":1769,"width":102,"height":33},{"text":"자식","x":1507,"y":1766,"width":66,"height":35}]},{"text":"노드인 D를 검은색으로 칠합니다. 마지막으로 부모 노드 A를 기준으로 좌회전을 수행한 후 이중 혹","words":[{"text":"노드인","x":192,"y":1834,"width":92,"height":31},{"text":"D를","x":295,"y":1834,"width":61,"height":31},{"text":"검은색으로","x":368,"y":1833,"width":159,"height":33},{"text":"칠합니다.","x":538,"y":1833,"width":133,"height":33},{"text":"마지막으로","x":685,"y":1833,"width":150,"height":33},{"text":"부모","x":844,"y":1832,"width":60,"height":32},{"text":"노드","x":913,"y":1834,"width":61,"height":25},{"text":"A를","x":982,"y":1832,"width":57,"height":31},{"text":"기준으로","x":1048,"y":1831,"width":121,"height":33},{"text":"좌회전을","x":1178,"y":1832,"width":124,"height":34},{"text":"수행한","x":1311,"y":1833,"width":97,"height":34},{"text":"후","x":1417,"y":1834,"width":36,"height":34},{"text":"이중","x":1464,"y":1832,"width":67,"height":35},{"text":"혹","x":1541,"y":1832,"width":37,"height":34}]},{"text":"색 노-드 c가 갖고 있던 검은,의 중 하나를 뿌리 노드에 넘깁니다.","words":[{"text":"색","x":192,"y":1896,"width":28,"height"